      model_answer: 'We can test four deliveries of up to six boxes. Please collect two empties on Wednesday at the side entrance so we can store the rest without blocking the aisle. On Friday our duty manager will count the empties with your driver and confirm the total in writing before any missing-box charge. If the Wednesday collection is missed, please arrange a same-day pickup or reduce the following delivery. We can review the storage arrangement with both teams after the first week.',
